{"title":"몽둥이기사 단","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=bNjkaM/dJMcaiDH2bI/5tKwHY4PDon9Vk9fzXeaC1&filename=th3","synopsis":"천재 타자 김단. 정신을 차려보니 낯선 이세계였다.\n\n손에 쥔 것은 의문의 몽둥이.\n괴물을 쓰러뜨릴 때마다 그 힘이 몸에 쌓이고, 상처는 회복되며, 단은 점점 인간을 넘어서는 존재로 성장한다.\n\n돌아가기 위해, 그리고 살아남기 위해.\n단은 도깨비의 힘이 깃든 방망이를 휘두르며 괴물과 전쟁, 뒤엉킨 정치판을 정면으로 돌파한다.\n\n이세계에 떨어진 고교야구 최강타자, 이제 배트 하나로 판타지 세계를 뒤흔든다.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":121,"change":{"type":"down","amount":26}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":121,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":124,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":123,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":113,"change":{"type":"up","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":139,"change":{"type":"down","amount":26}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":132,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":132,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":147,"change":{"type":"down","amount":15}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":151,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":142,"change":{"type":"up","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":129,"change":{"type":"up","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":140,"change":{"type":"down","amount":11}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":147,"change":{"type":"down","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":134,"change":{"type":"up","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":137,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":140,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":143,"change":{"type":"down","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":158,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":136,"change":{"type":"up","amount":22}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":165,"change":{"type":"down","amount":29}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":162,"change":{"type":"up","amount":3}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":162,"change":{"type":"same"